      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILLIBY ZUCCHINI (7) again had no luck at the draw last start. Pushed forward to settle handy then boxed on gamely and scored by 4 metres at Horsham over 1700m. The driver has some work to do again from this wide starting position. Leading hope if she gets the right breaks. BLACK OPAL JACK (11) is back from a break of four months and looks to be right up to the mark following a recent trial win. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Sure to prove hard to beat on his return. JOE GOT ROLLED (2) gets a good draw for her return so keep safe. HUXHAM CHUBB (4) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 2190m at Maryborough.",
